# Frontend env template (safe to commit).
# Vite only exposes variables prefixed with VITE_ to the browser.
#
# Never put OPENAI_API_KEY (or any API secret) here.
# OpenAI is backend-only — see backend/.env.example.

# Optional: override API base for non-proxy setups (default empty = same-origin / Vite proxy)
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=

# Optional: footer version stamp (Docker build arg also sets this)
# VITE_APP_VERSION=0.8.0
